{"title":"Career roadmap — Illustrator","role":"Illustrator","summary":"An Illustrator creates original visual artwork to communicate ideas, stories, concepts and information across publishing, advertising, branding, entertainment, editorial, packaging, education, gaming and digital media. Modern illustrators increasingly combine drawing + visual storytelling + graphic design + digital tools + motion + 3D + AI-assisted workflows.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Communication / Graphic Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Illustrator creates original visual artwork to communicate ideas, stories, concepts and information across publishing, advertising, branding, entertainment, editorial, packaging, education, gaming and digital media. Modern illustrators increasingly combine drawing + visual storytelling + graphic design + digital tools + motion + 3D + AI-assisted workflows."},{"type":"h","text":"The strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Drawing Fundamentals","Visual Storytelling","Digital Illustration","Design Thinking","Portfolio","Industry Specialisation"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build drawing, composition, colour, visual storytelling and digital illustration skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Work as Junior Illustrator/Visual Artist in publishing, agencies, studios, brands or digital media"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Specialise in editorial, children's books, advertising, entertainment, gaming, concept art or brand illustration"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Become Lead Illustrator, Art Director, Visual Director, independent artist or illustration-studio founder"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Drawing and visual founda